# S3 buckets (Terraform state bucket in bootstrap/, assets bucket in
# modules/assets-bucket) use SSE-S3 (AES256) on purpose. A customer-managed
# KMS key adds cost and key-rotation/IAM overhead with no meaningful gain at
# this project's current stage.
AVD-AWS-0132

# modules/network: the instance security group allows unrestricted egress
# (0.0.0.0/0). The small stg EC2 instance has no NAT gateway or VPC
# endpoints, so it needs direct outbound access for package installs, ECR
# pulls and third-party API calls.
AVD-AWS-0104

# modules/network: the public subnet assigns public IPs by design. There is
# no NAT gateway in this environment, so the instance needs a public IP for
# inbound/outbound traffic.
AVD-AWS-0164
